  "unit_caveats": [
    "All six mechanical fields are required in a proposal; one-coordinate experiments retain the other five values.",
    "Proposal wheel_mass_kg excludes the motor rotor mass. Compiled D-WHEEL-MASS includes it.",
    "Effective wheel radius equals side_m multiplied by wheel_radius_ratio; do not search both as independent coordinates.",
    "With wheel mass and radius fixed, thickness changes transverse inertia but not axial inertia in the current compiler.",
    "Motor family is an existing discrete component-package choice; its assumed mass and drive properties are not independently adjustable identification parameters.",
    "Four optional controller inputs exist: tilt_q_scale, rate_q_scale, momentum_q_scale, yaw_rate_gain_nm_s. They have no dedicated KDP IDs in the selected 37-record registry; this draft adds none.",
    "The six compiler inputs are an implementation inventory, not a decision to optimize all six."
  ],
